==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the Doge Dark with [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], then start stalling Zigge with [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] while you stack up [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]] (alongside [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]], if you want). By the time you kill Zigge, your initial Yellow Nyanko Ranger will reach the enemy base and summon Countess Koryessa, but she's the least of your concerns here. The Nyanko Rangers will make quick work of her, so focus on the Zombies that burrow past. Once Koryessa is dead, there is no longer anything stopping you from reaching the base.

